        "superseded_error": null,
        "superseded_justification": "MIMIC-on-FHIR carries no ICU input-event/link-order identifier at MedicationAdministration.identifier.value. The upstream ETL mimic-fhir/sql/fhir_medication_administration_icu.sql:7-23,38-103 neither selects linkorderid nor writes any input-event identifier; its opaque resource UUID cannot recover linkorderid. This explains all 16,892 keyed differing_null_only rows. There are no missing, invented, or conflicting rows, and all representable columns agree on every row. The complete row set and every clinically representable value are reproduced, so the intrinsic gap is accepted rather than blocked.",
